          "at": "2026-11-07T04:31:40.751Z",
          "html": "<p>Yes:  planned in <a href=\"#p34\">P34 · More Fixes From The Examples</a>.  A percent unit on the units P23-P24 built:  <code>18%</code> reads, <code>type=\"percent\"</code> declares it, and it shows with its % sign the reader&apos;s way;  bill-splitter&apos;s tip uses it.</p>"
